1
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,240
今晚，我要在赛道上试驾一辆经典的捷豹。
Tonight, I try a classic
Jaguar on our track.

2
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:19,120
哈蒙德在马自达全新的MX5里玩得不亦乐乎。
Hammond has a blast
in Mazda's new MX5.

3
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:24,310
然后詹姆斯喊道：“哎呀，哎呀，哎呀，哎呀，哎呀。”
And James says, "Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow."

4
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,160
哎呀，哎呀，哎呀，哎呀，哎呀！
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

5
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:37,390
谢谢大家，真是太感谢了，谢谢！
Thank you, everybody, thank
you so much, thank you!

6
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:39,430
大家好，晚上好。
Hello, good evening.

7
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:40,950
谢谢各位。
Thanks, everyone.

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,710
几年前，捷豹给我们带来了F-Type敞篷版
Now, a couple of years ago Jaguar
gave us the F-Type convertible

9
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:48,870
现在又出了F-Type硬顶版。
and now there's the F-Type coupe.

10
00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:51,670
它有两款V6发动机可选
You can have it with a
choice of two V6 engines

11
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:56,150
或者只要85,000英镑，就能配上那台震天响的V8。
or, for £85,000, a thumping great V8.

12
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:58,740
猜猜我开的是哪一款？
So guess which one I've been driving?

13
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:15,710
漂亮吧？
Beautiful, isn't it?

14
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:21,160
好看得让人眼泪直流。
Beautiful enough to cause dribbling.

15
00:01:26,480 --> 00:01:29,070
而且野性十足。
And aggressive as well.

16
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:31,190
凶巴巴的。
Snarly.

17
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:32,800
愤怒。
Angry.

18
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:39,110
而且不同于软顶的F-Type，
And unlike the soft-top F-Type,

19
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:43,120
它自带后备箱，能装下好多东西。
it comes with a boot, into
which you can put many things.

20
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:48,710
敞篷的后备箱只能装顶帽子。
All you could get in the boot of
a convertible is a peaked cap.

21
00:01:48,760 --> 00:01:52,310
可是这儿能装下所有想得到的帽子，
But in here, there's room for
every conceivable type of hat,

22
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:53,630
一次性全装进去。
all at the same time.

23
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:56,550
船长帽、土耳其帽、象牙帽、三角帽，
A boater, a fez, a
pith helmet, a trilby,

24
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:59,070
还有詹姆斯的专属帽子。
one of James's special hats.

25
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:02,750
甚至还能再塞进一顶英国军官帽。
And there's still room
leftover for a busby.

26
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:04,600
给你看看。
There you go.

27
00:02:09,200 --> 00:02:12,510
好消息还在继续。
And the good news keeps on coming.

28
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:16,350
因为捷豹把那台增压V8玩了玩儿，
Because Jaguar has fiddled around
with the supercharged V8

29
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:21,200
现在能输出542马力。
so it now produces 542 horsepower.

30
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:34,310
比敞篷版多了54马力，
That is 54 more than you
get in the convertible,

31
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:38,110
这意味着它的最高时速简直是百万。
which means this has a
top speed of a million.

32
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:41,230
快得离谱。
It is outrageously fast.

33
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:44,840
我的天，那可是160英里每小时。
I mean, that is 160mph.

34
00:02:47,160 --> 00:02:49,720
我后备箱里已经装了17顶帽子。
And I've got 17 hats in the boot.

35
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:57,400
不过比速度更让人惊叹的是这车的制造工艺。
But even more impressive than the
speed is the way this car is made.

36
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:02,950
他们可不是随便装个车顶——整侧面全是全新的。
They haven't simply bolted on
a roof - the whole side is new.

37
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,150
就是它本身。
And this is it.

38
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:08,230
它是一整块铝材，重量竟然只有……
It's one piece of aluminium
and it only weighs...

39
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:10,030
三块多公斤。
three and a bit kilograms.

40
00:03:10,080 --> 00:03:13,710
而且因为是一体成型，强度更高，
And because it's one piece,
there's more strength,

41
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:16,360
更安全，少点弹性。
more safety and less flex.

42
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:20,720
弹性少了，操控更好。
And less flex means better handling.

43
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:36,670
我以为敞篷车已经够好了，
但这个……
I thought the convertible
was good, but this...

44
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:38,640
这个更牛逼。
this is even better.

45
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:43,350
它的弹簧硬度竟然比敞篷车还硬，
这倒是没让乘坐感受怎么舒服，
It's actually got tougher
springs than the convertible

46
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:46,270
但……
which doesn't do much
for the ride but...

47
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:48,990
天啊，开起来好爽啊。
God, it makes it fun
to drive out here.

48
00:03:57,400 --> 00:04:00,140
这感觉就是在诗里开车。
It is like driving
around in some poetry.

49
00:04:01,040 --> 00:04:04,040
泰德·休斯的诗，虽然说是诗。
Ted Hughes poetry, but
poetry nevertheless.

50
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:11,150
这车居然配了电子差速器，玩儿大了会过热
This actually has an electronic
differential, which can overheat

51
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:13,950
如果你开疯了。不过……
if you go too mad. But...

52
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,190
只要你别玩脱
providing you stay
within the parameters

53
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:19,840
保持点常识，这玩意儿简直棒呆了。
of reasonable common
sense, it's fabulous.

54
00:04:21,640 --> 00:04:24,640
我真找不到第二辆像它这么特的车。
I just don't know of another
car quite like this.

55
00:04:28,760 --> 00:04:30,830
而且那是半油门的表现。
And that's half throttle.

56
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:34,500
对，你干得好！
Yes, you're good!

57
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:42,070
所以它既好看又暴烈，还超快
So it's pretty and violent and fast

58
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:44,920
而且比你想象的还实用。
and more practical than
you might imagine.

59
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:52,550
但不可避免的，这车也有点小毛病。
Inevitably, however,
there are a few niggles.

60
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:56,190
第一点，在斜交路口根本看不清
Number one, at oblique junctions
it's really hard to see

61
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:58,070
有没有车要出来。
if anything is coming.

62
00:04:58,120 --> 00:05:02,640
所以我们就在跑道边儿停一下，看看吧。
So pull up here at the edge
of our runway and look.

63
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:08,190
我唯一能安全驶出的办法就是祈祷
The only way I can pull out safely
is by crossing my fingers

64
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,590
抱着最佳期待。
and hoping for the best.

65
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,680
啊！
Ah!

66
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:16,120
脑残！
Stupid idiot!

67
00:05:17,640 --> 00:05:19,780
还有别的坑。
There are other issues too.

68
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,550
如果把座椅往后推到尽头，
If you push the seat
all the way back,

69
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,510
而且你个子高的话，你会想要，
and if you're tall, you'll want to,

70
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:28,060
皮革在舱壁上吱嘎作响——能听见吗？
the leather squeaks on the
bulkhead - can you hear that?

71
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,540
真是烦人。
Really irritating.

72
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:37,710
还有那套控制系统，居然是触摸屏。
And then there's the control
system, which is touch screen.

73
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:39,710
听起来还行
Now that sounds fine

74
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:43,430
但这车里太颠簸，尤其是低速时，
but it's so bumpy in here,
at low speeds particularly,

75
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:45,270
根本不好把手指
that it's very difficult
to get your finger

76
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:47,110
点在正确的位置。
to go in the right place.

77
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:50,870
要是换电台时不小心，
If you're not very careful when you
try to change the radio station,

78
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:54,270
就会把车厢灯光颜色改了，
you can end up altering the colour
of the interior lighting

79
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:58,920
或者误开动态驾驶的疯子模式。
or engaging Mad Mode on the
dynamic driving system.

80
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:03,320
啊！我想听古典FM啊！
Aah! I wanted Classic FM!

81
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:11,390
但这车最大的毛病是
它根本停不下来，一直在吼。
But the biggest problem with this
car is that it never stops shouting.

82
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:17,070
你可以在这里按下这个按钮
让排气系统安静点
You can push this button here
to quieten the exhaust system

83
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,590
但每次你
靠近油门时，
but every time you
go near the throttle,

84
00:06:19,640 --> 00:06:22,110
它又会立刻炸毛，重新嗡嗡作响。
it all bursts back into life again.

85
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:27,910
这车有点像
会拉小提琴的孩子。
This car's a little bit like a
child that can play the violin.

86
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:30,470
前五分钟还能忍。
For five minutes, it's fine.

87
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:34,990
但过了一个月后，你可能会开始
暗示要是它不停的话，
But after a month, you might start
to suggest that if it doesn't stop,

88
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:38,550
你就会把消音箱直接塞进它的……
you will shove the sound
box right up its...

89
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,590
安静？
Peace and quiet?

90
00:06:46,640 --> 00:06:49,520
这可是
这车根本做不到的事儿。
That's not something
this car can ever do.

91
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:58,790
好在，还有另一款
全新的捷豹稍微没那么……
Happily, however, there's another
new Jaguar which is a bit less...

92
00:06:58,840 --> 00:07:00,110
粗犷。
louty.

93
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:10,430
几年前，我们测评了
这辆鹰式速派。
A few years ago, we tested
this, the Eagle Speedster.

94
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:14,920
而现在造它的公司
又玩起了另一款。
And now the company that created
it has come up with something else.

95
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,590
它叫做 Low Drag GT
It's called the Low Drag GT

96
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:26,510
是一款对唯一的
赛用 E-Type 原型车的再造
and it's a re-creation of a one-off
racing E-Type prototype

97
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:29,200
那是捷豹于 1960 年打造的。
that Jaguar made in 1960.

98
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:43,470
不过“再造”这个词不太贴切，
Except re-creation is the wrong word,

99
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:47,150
因为鹰公司实际做的
是把原始设计
because what Eagle has actually
done is taken the basic design

100
00:07:47,200 --> 00:07:51,790
和原车的精神
带进了现代。
and the spirit of the original
and then brought them up to date.

101
00:07:51,840 --> 00:07:55,280
想象一下，它就像
一座装了 Wi‑Fi 的乔治亚风格别墅。
Think of it, then, as a
Georgian house with Wi-Fi.

102
00:07:56,400 --> 00:08:00,200
也许配上那种
乔治亚风格的克鲁尼咖啡机。
And perhaps one of those Georgian
Clooney coffee machines.

103
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,510
先从发动机说起。
Let's start with the engine.

104
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:09,510
和原车一样，它是
双凸轮直列六缸。
Like the original, it's
a twin cam straight six.

105
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:14,310
但不同于原版，它用
油喷而不是化油器。
But unlike the original, it has fuel
injection rather than carburettors.

106
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,900
所以它能跑。
So it works.

107
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:21,520
它是铝合金材质，
不是铸铁，所以轻盈。
It's made from aluminium rather
than cast iron, so it's light.

108
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:26,320
还有冷却系统，
不会轻易过热。
It also has cooling so
it doesn't overheat.

109
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:29,900
而且它比原版大……
And it's bigger than the original...

110
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:33,440
……这就意味着更有马力。
.. which means it's more powerful.

111
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:44,230
原车 3.8 升，
只能输出 265 马力。
The original car had 3.8 litres
and produced 265 horsepower.

112
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:47,230
这款升到 4.7 升
This has 4.7 litres

113
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:52,230
输出 345 马力！
and produces 345 horsepower!

114
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:54,510
所以它更快……
So it's faster...

115
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:56,240
快得多！
MUCH faster!

116
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:03,630
想让你了解这车有多像
一艘火箭，
To give you an idea of what
a rocket ship this car is,

117
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:05,390
我要和它来场直线加速赛
I'm going to have a drag race

118
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:09,270
对手是丰田的
现代跑车理念——
with Toyota's idea of
a modern-day sports car.

119
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,560
GT‑86。
The GT-86.

120
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:18,430
好，60 年代的孩子
对阵 21 世纪的玩意。
Right, so a child of the '60s
versus the 21st century.

121
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:27,840
三、二、一，冲！
Three, two, one, go!

122
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:32,830
开局火力全开。
It's a smoking start.

123
00:09:32,880 --> 00:09:35,230
我们已经起跑啦。
And we are away.

124
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:37,390
简直惊呆了。
That's incredible.

125
00:09:37,440 --> 00:09:41,720
珍妮丝·乔普林正拳击贾斯汀·比伯的脸。
Janis Joplin is punching
Justin Bieber in the face.

126
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:46,910
到终点线了。
And there's the finishing line.

127
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:49,100
这场胜利轻松拿下。
Yeah, it's an easy victory.

128
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:54,310
我一直说，我那个年代的东西更好，
I've always said things
were better in my day,

129
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,910
除了得了佝偻病。
apart from the rickets.

130
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:59,670
还有白喉病。事实证明了。
And the diphtheria.
And this proves it.

131
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:02,320
在弯道里也相当不错。
It's even pretty good in the corners.

132
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:18,880
我可不敢说它有现代感，根本没有。
I'm not going to say this feels
modern because it doesn't.

133
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:25,790
F-Type 绕它跑上几圈都不够。
The F-Type would run rings around it.

134
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,510
但关键是……
But crucially...

135
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:31,310
…它一点都不比我老，
.. it doesn't feel as old as me,

136
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,230
这正是它的本色。
which is what it is.

137
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:39,310
但并不是操控或动力
But it's not the handling
or the power

138
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:45,030
或是每小时170英里极速让人印象深刻。
or the 170-mile-an-hour top
speed that impresses most.

139
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:47,400
真正让人惊讶的是细节。
It's the attention to detail.

140
00:10:49,160 --> 00:10:52,430
我的意思是，这车配了五速变速箱，
I mean, because this car
has a five-speed gearbox

141
00:10:52,480 --> 00:10:54,950
而不是原版的四速，
rather than the four-speeder
you got in the original,

142
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:58,510
Eagle 甚至特制了个档位旋钮来体现这一点，
Eagle has even made a special
gear knob to reflect that

143
00:10:58,560 --> 00:11:00,910
旋钮上写着‘5’。
with a five on it.

144
00:11:00,960 --> 00:11:03,630
我早就直接用修正液了。
I'd have just used Tipp-Ex.

145
00:11:03,680 --> 00:11:06,870
看看这副遮阳板。
And look at these sun visors.

146
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:10,910
它们太棒了，总得有人把它们和支架做出来，
They're fabulous and somebody
had to make them and the bracket

147
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:14,160
还有把它们拧在一起的螺丝和铰链。
and the bolts that hold
it together and the hinge.

148
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,590
这，这简直是……
That's, that's just...

149
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:20,760
真是让人难以置信，语塞。
It's all just too
incredible for words.

150
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,920
而且还有更多。
And there's more.

151
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:27,790
轮胎——看起来像是钢铸的，
The wheels - they look like
they're made out of steel

152
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:29,790
好像是从汽车用品折扣店买来的，
and they came from a
motorist discount store,

153
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:34,790
但其实是手工用镁合金特制的。
but actually they were specially
made by hand out of magnesium.

154
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:37,750
而且车身是 Eagle 自己的设计，
And because the body
is Eagle's own design,

155
00:11:37,800 --> 00:11:40,550
这个挡风玻璃必须专门定制。
this windscreen had
to be specially made.

156
00:11:40,600 --> 00:11:42,830
于是只能去找玻璃工匠，
Now that meant going to a glassmaker

157
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:46,750
让他给我们做一块玻璃？
and saying can you
make ONE windscreen?

158
00:11:46,800 --> 00:11:48,990
一块！
One!

