595
00:34:09,600 --> 00:34:11,150
因为真奇怪，我一点都没变……
Cos it's weird, I haven't changed...

596
00:34:11,200 --> 00:34:14,230
我的意思是，你变化挺大的，但我现在完全跟以前一样，
I mean, you've changed a lot,
but I'm exactly the same now

597
00:34:14,280 --> 00:34:16,110
就跟我们一开始时一样。
as I was when we first started.

598
00:34:16,160 --> 00:34:17,950
那时候你一定很激动，
So you must have been thrilled, then,

599
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:20,630
毕竟你从小就是车迷，
if you were a car enthusiast
from a young age,

600
00:34:20,680 --> 00:34:23,310
还能被邀请出演新《疯狂麦克斯》电影的角色，我猜你也是如此，
to have been offered a part in
the new Mad Max movie, I presume,

601
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:25,950
这就是——我们所熟知的
which is - as we know
from the early ones -

602
00:34:26,000 --> 00:34:27,670
~ 这么多车。
~ 是啊，是啊，是啊。
~ a lot of cars.
~ Yeah, yeah, yeah.

603
00:34:27,720 --> 00:34:30,350
那本来应该是澳洲口音——废话。
That was supposed be an
Australian accent - rubbish.

604
00:34:30,400 --> 00:34:32,430
是啊，因为我喜欢原版电影。
Yeah, cos I loved the original films.

605
00:34:32,480 --> 00:34:35,270
然后，这事儿太离奇了，你会在片场
And then, it's the weirdest
thing, you'd be there on set,

606
00:34:35,320 --> 00:34:37,790
他们会弄一堆车辆的大舰队
and they'd have these armadas
of all these vehicles

607
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:39,830
专门为拍摄打造的
that they'd specially
made for the shoot,

608
00:34:39,880 --> 00:34:41,510
全是V8、V12，轰鸣不止
all these V8s, V12s, all roaring.

609
00:34:41,560 --> 00:34:44,390
然后你坐在自己的车里，看着其他车的火焰
And you'd be sitting there in your
car, and flames of all these other

610
00:34:44,440 --> 00:34:47,830
那些车飞驰而过，骑车的家伙们，你真的冷汗直冒
cars would go flying past you, guys
on bikes, and you just get chills.

611
00:34:47,880 --> 00:34:50,830
但唯一的问题是，根本听不清任何声音
But the only problem with it
is you can't hear anything

612
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:52,590
因为引擎太吵了
cos the engines are all so loud.

613
00:34:52,640 --> 00:34:54,750
你坐在那里，然后会看到摄像机
You'd sit there, and then
you'd see the camera

614
00:34:54,800 --> 00:34:56,470
好像在你视线边缘出现
kind of come into your periphery,

615
00:34:56,520 --> 00:34:58,430
接着听到屋顶砰砰响
and then you'd hear
a bang on the roof,

616
00:34:58,480 --> 00:35:00,470
可能是有人在喊台词
and that was maybe someone
saying their line.

617
00:35:00,520 --> 00:35:02,950
所以你只能大概猜什么时候该动
So you're just kind of guessing
when to act, essentially.

618
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:06,430
只能祈祷一切顺利，根本不知道自己在片子里哪儿
Just hoping for the best, not knowing
exactly where you were in the film.

619
00:35:06,480 --> 00:35:07,830
我们其实手里有段片子
We've actually got a clip.

620
00:35:07,880 --> 00:35:09,710
来看看新《疯狂麦克斯》吧
Let's have a look at
the new Mad Max movie.

621
00:35:09,760 --> 00:35:11,360
我叫麦克斯
My name is Max.

622
00:35:25,600 --> 00:35:28,000
哇，今天真是太棒了！多美好的一天呀！
Oh, what a day! What a lovely day!

623
00:35:58,040 --> 00:36:00,830
这看起来真像我喜欢的片子，我想我们所有人的都行
That does look like my kind of film,
I think all our kinds of films.

624
00:36:00,880 --> 00:36:03,230
我们会……是啊，我会排队等那部的
We would... Yeah, I'll be
queuing up for that one.

625
00:36:03,280 --> 00:36:06,230
但那车还活着，疯狂麦克斯的……？是福特猎鹰
But the car has survived, the
Mad Max...? It's a Ford Falcon.

626
00:36:06,280 --> 00:36:08,950
它还在。这次稍微改动了一下
That's still there. It gets adapted
a little bit in this one.

627
00:36:09,000 --> 00:36:11,950
这真太厉害了，细节做到位
This was amazing, like, the attention
to detail in all of these.

628
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:14,510
我的车，他们做了四个版本，因为要翻滚
My car, they had four versions
of it, because they had to flip

629
00:36:14,560 --> 00:36:17,470
和翻转，干各种事，但每个车都有，像是
and roll and do all sorts of
stuff, but each one had, like,

630
00:36:17,520 --> 00:36:19,950
我的角色名，Nux，刻在刹车片上
my character's name, Nux,
engraved into the brake pad

631
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:21,270
以及各种奇葩细节
and all these sorts of things.

632
00:36:21,320 --> 00:36:23,110
当你坐进去，一切都运转
When you got in there
everything worked

633
00:36:23,160 --> 00:36:26,390
都有它的用意，制作组真的想得很周到
and had a reason to be there, they'd
had really thought about everything.

634
00:36:26,440 --> 00:36:29,230
所以这里根本不用特效？真的是把车翻过去？
So there's no CGI in this, then?
It really is roll a car over?

635
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:31,070
是啊，他们真的在这么搞
Yeah, they were really
going for it, yeah.

636
00:36:31,120 --> 00:36:33,350
说真的，这简直是我心目中的天堂
Well, I mean, that just sounds
like my idea of heaven.

637
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:35,710
这…是啊，你以为这就是你的天堂
It was... Yeah, you think
it's your idea of heaven

638
00:36:35,760 --> 00:36:37,910
直到他们往你后面撞卡车
until they're crashing trucks
into the back of you.

639
00:36:37,960 --> 00:36:39,670
你来第一段拍摄时，你会想
And you do the first
take and you're like,

640
00:36:39,720 --> 00:36:42,390
“没事儿，别担心，快点再来，冲啊！”
"Yeah, I'm fine, don't worry about
it, do it faster, go for it."

641
00:36:42,440 --> 00:36:44,750
于是，下次你在场景里转身时，
And then the next time
you turn around mid-scene,

642
00:36:44,800 --> 00:36:47,510
回头一看，有卡车冲着你飞来，
you look over your shoulder and
there's this truck flying at you,

643
00:36:47,560 --> 00:36:50,750
你就嚎“砰！”，在车里被甩得七上八下，装得好像没事。
and you're like, "Boof!", getting
thrown around inside, trying to act.

644
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:53,070
你在片场真是灾星呀，难道不是吗？
You are quite accident prone
on films, are you not?

645
00:36:53,120 --> 00:36:55,750
因为你拍《X‑战警》时…因为你的搭档是法斯宾德…？
Cos when you were on X-Men...
Cos you've got Fassbender on...?

646
00:36:55,800 --> 00:36:56,830
对，法斯宾德。
Yeah, Fassbender.

647
00:36:56,880 --> 00:36:59,030
因为他讲了一堆关于你当时的惊天动地的事…
Cos he told some amazing
stories of what you got...

648
00:36:59,080 --> 00:37:00,590
在那时赛车式的高尔夫球车…
Racing golf buggies when he was...

649
00:37:00,640 --> 00:37:03,150
哦，对，他和詹姆斯撞坏了一辆高尔夫球车，导致
Oh, yeah, him and James crashed
a golf buggy and caused

650
00:37:03,200 --> 00:37:05,830
他们自己以及现场的一辆车受了相当严重的损伤。
quite a lot of damage to themselves
and one of the cars on set.

651
00:37:05,880 --> 00:37:06,990
是啊，他确实提过这事。
Yeah, he did mention that.

652
00:37:07,040 --> 00:37:09,230
你没参与那场高尔夫球车赛吗？
You didn't get involved
in the golf buggy racing?

653
00:37:09,280 --> 00:37:11,350
结果他们把车给收走了。
Well, they took them away after that.

654
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:13,310
我们会来点儿高尔夫球车赛的刺激。
We'd do a little bit
of golf buggy racing.

655
00:37:13,360 --> 00:37:15,750
于是，接下来，在上一部片子里，
So then, our next one,
on the last film

656
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:18,670
我和詹姆斯去买了气枪，互相来一场射击。
me and James went and bought BB
guns and we'd shoot each other.

657
00:37:18,720 --> 00:37:20,550
于是你早上骑车去片场，
So you'd be riding
to set in the morning,

658
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:22,350
戴上护目镜，装好弹夹，
you'd put your goggles
on, load your clip,

659
00:37:22,400 --> 00:37:24,550
下车后，还没等你适应，
you'd get out of the car and
then, before you knew it,

660
00:37:24,600 --> 00:37:27,150
就有三个人像追逐猎物一样冲向你的拖车。
there were three people, like,
chasing you to your trailer.

661
00:37:27,200 --> 00:37:29,430
~ 射你？  
~ 对，但我们得停下来
~ Shooting you?
~ Yeah, but then we had to stop that

662
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:31,150
因为有人被子弹打到面部。
cos people got shot in the face.

663
00:37:31,200 --> 00:37:33,070
血直流。
And you'd bleed.

664
00:37:33,120 --> 00:37:34,990
我本来想说会留下难看的伤痕。
I was going to say it would
leave an ugly mark.

665
00:37:35,040 --> 00:37:37,630
是啊，会起皱或者流血，于是被告知不能再这么玩了
Yeah, it would welt or bleed, so
we got told we weren't allowed

666
00:37:37,680 --> 00:37:39,230
~ 再也不能这么干了，所以……  
~ 哎呀！
~ to do that any more, either, so...
~ Aw!

667
00:37:39,280 --> 00:37:41,430
还真不知道下一次该整点啥。
Don't know what we're going
to do on the next one.

668
00:37:41,480 --> 00:37:44,390
难道这就是你最近开始织毛衣的原因？
Is that why you've
now taken up knitting?

669
00:37:44,440 --> 00:37:45,590
对！
Yeah!

670
00:37:45,640 --> 00:37:46,950
哦，织毛衣啊。
Oh, the knitting, yeah.

671
00:37:47,000 --> 00:37:49,630
在《疯狂的麦克斯》那儿，现场闲得慌，
On Mad Max, there was
a lot of hanging around,

672
00:37:49,680 --> 00:37:51,870
于是有位化妆师某天在织毛衣，
so one of make-up artists
was knitting one day

673
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:54,310
我就想，这倒是个消磨时间的好办法。
and I was like, "That seems
like a good way to kill time."

674
00:37:54,360 --> 00:37:56,110
于是，我坐在那里，边坐边织，
So, I'd sit there,
sit there knitting,

675
00:37:56,160 --> 00:37:58,870
结果一弄错就超郁闷，
and then getting really frustrated
with myself when I'd mess up,

676
00:37:58,920 --> 00:38:00,790
在片场大吼大叫，像是，
like, storming around
the set being like,

677
00:38:00,840 --> 00:38:02,910
“哎呀！有人帮我弄好…
"Argh! Can someone fix my...

678
00:38:02,960 --> 00:38:04,070
…这织毛衣的事？”
"..knitting?"

679
00:38:04,120 --> 00:38:05,390
“拜托。”
"Please."

680
00:38:05,440 --> 00:38:07,390
他们帮我修好后，我就说，‘谢谢’，
And then they'd fix it
up, I'd go, "Thank you,"

681
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:09,750
我就回到自己的角落，坐在那里。
and I'd go back off to
my corner and sit there.

682
00:38:09,800 --> 00:38:12,900
我开始听别人下指令了。
I started, like, taking
orders from other people.

683
00:38:14,200 --> 00:38:15,550
~ 然后…… 
~ Beast会织毛衣。
~ And then...
~ Beast can knit.

684
00:38:15,600 --> 00:38:17,390
《疯狂麦克斯》里两个女孩要了帽子，
Two of the girls on Mad
Max asked for hats,

685
00:38:17,440 --> 00:38:18,510
我就说，好啊。
and I was like, OK.

686
00:38:18,560 --> 00:38:21,270
我正好休了一天，我就想，我得给她们织帽子。
I had one day off and I was like,
I've got to make these hats.

687
00:38:21,320 --> 00:38:23,230
于是当天我一直织了整整十个小时
So I knitted straight
for ten hours that day

688
00:38:23,280 --> 00:38:24,710
几乎没停过。
without really stopping.

689
00:38:24,760 --> 00:38:27,110
然后我就戒了，之后就再也没织过，因为我觉得
And then I quit, I haven't
knitted since, cos I was like,

690
00:38:27,160 --> 00:38:28,870
这事太夸张了，已经不有意思了。
this is too much, it's
not fun any more.

691
00:38:28,920 --> 00:38:31,750
听说过《使命召唤》吗？消磨时间简直棒极了。
Have you heard of Call Of Duty?
That's brilliant for killing time.

692
00:38:31,800 --> 00:38:34,310
我用《使命召唤》把星期都玩掉。织毛衣？好吧，就是这么回事。
I kill weeks with Call Of Duty.
Knitting? Well, there we are.

693
00:38:34,360 --> 00:38:36,070
好了，现在该聊聊你们的车了，
Now, it's time to
get on to your cars,

694
00:38:36,120 --> 00:38:38,910
因为我们已经确定了，你们爱车，且开过不少。
cos we've established you like
a car, and you've driven many.

695
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:40,830
你们开过一台Murcielago，对吧？
You've driven a
Murcielago, haven't you?

696
00:38:40,880 --> 00:38:42,670
是啊，我在新加坡开过一台。
Yeah, I got to drive
one in Singapore.

697
00:38:42,720 --> 00:38:44,710
去年我在新加坡拍摄电影。
I was shooting a film
in Singapore last year.

698
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:46,710
那可是台怪兽，真正的兰博基尼猛兽时代。
That's a beast, it was
proper Lambo beast days.

699
00:38:46,760 --> 00:38:47,910
是啊，换挡顺畅。
Yeah, it shifted.

700
00:38:47,960 --> 00:38:50,230
不过你们的第一辆车可不是什么豪车。
But your first car wasn't
any of those things.

701
00:38:50,280 --> 00:38:51,510
差不多。
It was similar.

702
00:38:51,560 --> 00:38:53,110
是一辆菲亚特Grande Punto。
It was a Fiat Grande Punto.

703
00:38:53,160 --> 00:38:54,430
~ Punto？ 
~ 红色的，没错。
~ Punto?
~ In red, yeah.

704
00:38:54,480 --> 00:38:55,710
这车挺狠的。
It's a mean car.

705
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:57,790
1.4升的狂暴。挺好，我很享受。
1.4 litres of mayhem. It
was good, I enjoyed it.

706
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:58,870
~ 1.4？ 
~ 对。
~ 1.4?
~ Yeah.

707
00:38:58,920 --> 00:39:00,270
哇，真是台猛兽。
Whoa, that's a beast.

708
00:39:00,320 --> 00:39:04,110
然后，想必是在菲亚特Punto里，
And then, presumably,
in a Fiat Punto,

709
00:39:04,160 --> 00:39:06,590
警察会中途拦截你吗...？
police interruptions
in your driving...?

710
00:39:06,640 --> 00:39:07,710
是啊，是啊，拦过一次。
Yeah, yeah, one.

711
00:39:07,760 --> 00:39:09,910
我从没在任何车上被开过超速罚单，
I've never got a speeding
ticket on anything,

712
00:39:09,960 --> 00:39:13,060
在摩托车上也没有，只有在Punto上。
not on my bike, nothing,
apart from in the Punto.

713
00:39:14,360 --> 00:39:16,630
那东西的最高时速是103，
And the max speed on
that thing is 103,

714
00:39:16,680 --> 00:39:19,950
我想我开得没超过它。我相当确定。
and I think I was doing under
that. I'm pretty sure.

715
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:22,710
然后我突然看到蓝灯，我心里想，“啊，完了”。
And I suddenly saw the blue lights
and I was like, "Oh, no."

716
00:39:22,760 --> 00:39:23,990
被拦下来，他说，
Pulled over, and he was like,

717
00:39:24,040 --> 00:39:25,870
“我已经追你一段时间了，
"I've been chasing
you for a while now,

718
00:39:25,920 --> 00:39:28,590
我得开到120，甚至130才追上你，
"and I had to do 120, maybe
130 to catch up with you,

719
00:39:28,640 --> 00:39:30,710
所以你肯定开得比这快。”
"so you were definitely
doing faster than that."

720
00:39:30,760 --> 00:39:32,110
我只好说，“好吧…”。
And I was like, "Well...

721
00:39:32,160 --> 00:39:33,470
逻辑不对。
"the logic is off."

722
00:39:33,520 --> 00:39:35,150
他说他在跑120，想追上你。
He said he was doing
120 to catch you up

723
00:39:35,200 --> 00:39:37,070
所以你一定跑得比那还快吧？
so you must have been
doing more than that?

724
00:39:37,120 --> 00:39:39,230
是啊，我当时心里想，这根本讲不通。
Yeah, and I was like, "This
doesn't make any sense.

725
00:39:39,280 --> 00:39:41,990
当然你比我快啊，你在追我。
"Of course you were going faster
than me, you were chasing me."

726
00:39:42,040 --> 00:39:43,630
你说你有辆摩托？
Did you say you had a bike?

727
00:39:43,680 --> 00:39:45,760
是啊，是的，杜卡迪 899。
Yeah. Yeah, a Ducati 899.

728
00:39:47,200 --> 00:39:49,630
我对摩托一点兴趣都没有。有人想聊摩托吗？
Not interested in bikes.
Anyone interested in bikes?

729
00:39:49,680 --> 00:39:50,750
有啊。
Yeah.

730
00:39:50,800 --> 00:39:52,400
天啊！呃……
Oh, God! Um...

731
00:39:53,520 --> 00:39:55,030
呃……你会骑吗？
Erm... do you ride it?

732
00:39:55,080 --> 00:39:57,620
会啊，我骑着转转，挺爽的。
Yeah, I ride it around, it's lovely.

733
00:39:57,840 --> 00:39:59,350
呃……
Um...

734
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:01,070
它……是什么颜色的？
Is it...? What colour is it?

735
00:40:01,120 --> 00:40:02,590
是白的。
It's white.

736
00:40:03,200 --> 00:40:04,400
是啊。
Yeah.

737
00:40:05,880 --> 00:40:08,670
我们能别聊摩托了吧？我想说说他的圈速。
Can we stop talking about bikes now?
I want to talk about his laps.

738
00:40:08,720 --> 00:40:12,350
~ 哦不！
~ 不是不是。你记得上周我们请了吉莉安·安德森来吗？
~ Oh, no!
~ No, no. You know last week
we had Gillian Anderson here?

739
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:15,910
她真的创下了新的记录，练习赛22秒……
And she did set a new
record of 22 practice

740
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:18,990
或者最快时间的尝试。你知道你多少次吗？
or attempts at the fastest time.
Do you know how many you did?

741
00:40:19,040 --> 00:40:20,390
呃，不，我没……
Uh, no, I wasn't...

742
00:40:20,440 --> 00:40:21,980
~ 24次！
~ 我做到吗？！
~ 24!
~ Did I?!

