807
00:43:21,240 --> 00:43:22,780
不过那边……
But there...

808
00:43:25,000 --> 00:43:27,440
来吧。来吧。
Come on. Come on.

809
00:43:28,600 --> 00:43:30,510
那也是差了0.1……
That is a tenth...

810
00:43:30,560 --> 00:43:32,430
Olly Murs 那家伙……
Olly Murs is like...

811
00:43:33,120 --> 00:43:34,830
但那真是个……
But that is a very...

812
00:43:34,880 --> 00:43:36,880
我的意思是，看起来很快。
I mean, it looked quick.

813
00:43:37,800 --> 00:43:39,070
看起来真的快。
It looked quick.

814
00:43:39,120 --> 00:43:41,910
要想跑出一圈全程顺风顺水，真是太难了。
It's really difficult to get a
lap where everything goes right.

815
00:43:41,960 --> 00:43:44,670
不，那是……这可是值得骄傲的成绩，1分44.7秒。
No, that is... That's a time
to be proud of, 1:44.7.

816
00:43:44,720 --> 00:43:46,510
~ 非常感谢你们来啦。 ~ 谢谢。
~ Thank you so much for coming.
~ Thank you.

817
00:43:46,560 --> 00:43:48,150
能请到你们真是太荣幸了。
Absolute pleasure to have you here.

818
00:43:48,200 --> 00:43:50,740
各位观众，尼古拉斯·霍尔特！
Ladies and gentlemen, Nicholas Hoult!

819
00:43:58,520 --> 00:44:01,470
现在，几季前，我们三个人
Now, a few series
ago, the three of us

820
00:44:01,520 --> 00:44:04,030
尝试了一把业余拉力赛，
tried our hand at amateur Rallycross,

821
00:44:04,080 --> 00:44:06,390
我们得出结论，按重量算，
and we decided that, pound for pound,

822
00:44:06,440 --> 00:44:09,110
这是世界上最刺激的运动。
it is the most exciting
sport in the world.

823
00:44:09,160 --> 00:44:12,710
而且我们太爱这业余赛事了，
And, because we enjoyed
the amateur event so much,

824
00:44:12,760 --> 00:44:15,150
于是顺理成章的下一步，就是让我们中的一个
the logical next step
was for one of us

825
00:44:15,200 --> 00:44:18,390
把它升格到职业水平。
to take it to a professional level.

826
