能挑起这艰巨任务。
to take on this challenging job.

828
00:44:24,480 --> 00:44:25,680
就是他。
Him.

829
00:44:33,080 --> 00:44:35,470
当我们玩业余拉力赛时，
When we did our amateur Rallycrossing,

830
00:44:35,520 --> 00:44:38,990
我们就在肯特的里登山岭赛道上跑过，
we raced here, at
Lidden Hill in Kent,

