我们的车子都是从分类广告里捡来的
and our cars were plucked from
the pages of the classifieds

832
00:44:42,680 --> 00:44:44,550
只花了几块钱。
for just a few quid.

833
00:44:46,280 --> 00:44:48,110
好吧，场地还是一样的。
Well, the venue is the same.

834
00:44:48,160 --> 00:44:50,790
明天的比赛就在这里举行。
This is where the event will
