00:44:50,840 --> 00:44:52,580
不过车子……
The car, though...

836
00:44:53,400 --> 00:44:55,470
这可是提升不少啊。
That's a bit of a step up.

837
00:44:56,400 --> 00:44:58,910
它起初是辆大众 Polo，
It starts out as a VW Polo,

