00:45:30,440 --> 00:45:31,670
慢速队长的乌龙现场。
Captain Slow cock-ups.

848
00:45:31,720 --> 00:45:34,390
但不，这次我或许真的还能行。
But no, I might actually
be OK at this.

849
00:45:36,680 --> 00:45:40,230
首先，这条赛道又短又好学。
For starters, the circuits
are small and easy to learn.

850
00:45:40,280 --> 00:45:43,470
而且这些车还有四驱系统。
The cars do have four-wheel drive.

851
00:45:43,520 --> 00:45:45,870
