And then there's the
calibre of the drivers.

852
00:45:45,920 --> 00:45:48,710
其中一个是这条赛道老板的儿子，
One of them is the son of the
bloke who owns this track,

853
00:45:48,760 --> 00:45:52,910
另一个则是美国版《Top Gear》的主持人。
and another is just a presenter
