00:46:04,840 --> 00:46:06,630
每 litre（升）就有 300 匹马力，
It's 300 horsepower per litre,

859
00:46:06,680 --> 00:46:09,990
0 到 100 公里加速只要 1.9 秒。
0-100 km in 1.9 seconds.

860
00:46:10,040 --> 00:46:12,990
比一辆 F1 车起步还快。
It's quicker than a Formula
One car off the line.

861
00:46:13,040 --> 00:46:14,990
~ 哇。
~ 还有别的优点，你懂的，
~ Wow.
~ Then the other things about it, you know,

862
00:46:15,040 --> 00:46:18,270
它是全轮驱动，稳定得惊人，
you've got all-wheel drive,
it's amazingly stable,

863
00:46:18,320 --> 00:46:21,910
遇到颠簸，它会把冲击全吸收，
you'll see a jump and it just
completely absorbs them,

864
00:46:21,960 --> 00:46:23,430
简直像棉花糖一样。
it's like marshmallow.

865
