~ 这事会发生的，没错。
~ So you can hit other cars?
~ It happens, yeah.

870
00:46:34,040 --> 00:46:38,830
'Tanner then pointed out the most important thing on the dashboard.'
'Tanner then pointed out the most
important thing on the dashboard.'

871
00:46:38,880 --> 00:46:42,390
这边的开关，就是这颗怪兽开关。
This switch here, this is the
monster switch right here.

872
00:46:42,440 --> 00:46:45,710
这是 ALS，防迟滞系统的开关。
This is the one that is the
ALS, for the anti-lag system.

