00:46:59,320 --> 00:47:01,550
而且那玩意儿相当暴力，
And it's a very violent thing,

879
00:47:01,600 --> 00:47:04,350
正是这点让这车动起来。
and that's really what
makes this car work.

880
00:47:04,400 --> 00:47:06,670
~ 好的。
~ 一跨过终点线，
~ OK.
~ Once you cross the finish line,

881
00:47:06,720 --> 00:47:09,190
把它关掉，车子又恢复正常了。
you flip that off and then
